{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13079","headline":"送李敖湖南书记 · 郎士元","name":"送李敖湖南书记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怜君才与阮家同，掌记能资亚相雄。\n入楚岂忘看泪竹，泊舟应自爱江枫。\n诚知客梦烟波里，肯厌猨鸣夜雨中。\n莫信衡湘书不到，年年秋鴈过巴东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}